OL,3,GNEWSAFrom a homeless orphan to a new   
OL,4,Alife: How 'Cisco' found 'paradise' on  
OL,5,AIsle of Man                            
OL,7,FA man who grew up as an orphan in      
OL,8,FRomania and later spent years living   
OL,9,Fhomeless around Europe has told how the
OL,10,FIsle of Man changed his life and       
OL,11,Fallowed him to finally find a home.    
OL,13,FFrancisc Olteanu arrived on this island
OL,14,Fin 2010 after a difficult childhood and
OL,15,Fyears spent living on the streets.     
OL,17,FKnown as Cisco, the 44-year-old said he
OL,18,Fwas fed, given a roof over his head,   
OL,19,Fhelped to find work - and has called   
OL,20,Fthe island home every since.           
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
