OL,3,GNEWSAFrom a homeless orphan to a new   
OL,4,Alife: How 'Cisco' found 'paradise' on  
OL,5,AIsle of Man                            
OL,7,F"I've never seen a kindness like it in 
OL,8,Fmy life," he said of how he had been   
OL,9,Fembraced by the Manx community. "It's  
OL,10,Flike I've stumbled upon paradise."     
